Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.50,0:14:55.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh. Oh, right. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.88,0:14:59.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为你还在跟他交往  他人很好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Because you're still seeing him, and, uh, he's a good guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.47,0:15:00.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我记得有一次\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I remember a time...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.51,0:15:06.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吧  好得很\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you okay? Yeah, totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.56,0:15:07.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好得很  你呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Totally. Are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.72,0:15:09.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,棒呆了  真的好神奇\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Great. It's so amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.81,0:15:13.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上次罗杰来的时候  我好紧张\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Y'know, Last time Dr. Roger came over, I was so nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.31,0:15:17.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是跟你过后  我变成了  "医生可以来看我了吗"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But after being with you, I'm like, "Can the doctor see me now?"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.03,0:15:19.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一定可以\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'll bet he can.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.61,0:15:23.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我虽然没有预约  但是我需要你来体检\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}"I don't have an appointment, but I sure could use a physical." Ha, ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.62,0:15:31.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你真的没事  没事  别管我  我很好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You sure you're okay? Oh yeah! Yeah! Don't worry about me, I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.09,0:15:44.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪  巴瑞\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}My God! Barry!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.80,0:15:48.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你说你周末都不在\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You said you'd be away all weekend! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.22,0:15:51.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没错  对不起  我回来早了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That's right, I'm sorry. I am early!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.35,0:15:54.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你们请   继续\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Finish, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.15,0:16:02.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,惊喜啊   看看谁回来了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Surprise, look who's back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.86,0:16:04.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  菲比  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Pheebs. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.70,0:16:06.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,通知警卫\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Call security.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.57,0:16:09.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  你不是被开除了吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pheebs, uh, didn't you get fired?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.54,0:16:11.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可不这么认为\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Heh, I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.20,0:16:14.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  杰克  嘿\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe? Jack! Hey. Ha,ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.12,0:16:17.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你来干什么  我好多了  回来上班\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are you doing here? All better. Back to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.96,0:16:20.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但这个研究部猪头说我被开除了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Except this clown from research told me I was fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.34,0:16:22.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,他应该用功一点\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}He should do his research, huh? Ha-ha-ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.47,0:16:25.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是被开除了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, you were fired.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.72,0:16:28.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没有\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Nuh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.72,0:16:30.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我跟帮你接电话的人说了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I told that guy who answered your phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.72,0:16:33.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,喔  我没收到留言  所以不算\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, okay. I didn't get that message. So this doesn't count.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.14,0:16:36.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那我先进办公室了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Anyway, I'll be in my office. Ah, heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.48,0:16:38.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  你没有办公室了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe, you don't have an office.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.57,0:16:41.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,没关系  我在这里工作\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}All right, I'll work right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.48,0:16:43.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这里很好  旁边有植物\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}This is good. Next to this plant.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.11,0:16:47.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  你闯入我的办公室了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Phoebe, let's-- You're in my office.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.99,0:16:53.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我替这家公司赚了很多钱  而且是大钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, I've made a lot of cash for this company. I am talking big bucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.62,0:16:57.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,披索  日圆  卢布  我才犯了一个小错\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pesos! Yen! Rubles! You make one little mistake--
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.42,0:16:59.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你损失了1千3百万元\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You lost 13 million dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.54,0:17:01.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,原来一切都是为了钱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}So now this is all about money?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.55,0:17:05.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我已经够\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know, it's bad enough that-- Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.22,0:17:07.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,别闹了吧\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, you have got to be kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.05,0:17:10.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗  我心脏病又发作了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you all right? I'm having another heart attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.05,0:17:14.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么   我的心脏病又发作了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? I'm having another heart attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.22,0:17:16.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,叫救护车\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Call 911!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.85,0:17:18.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,猪头\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Dumb-ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.86,0:17:22.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,菲比  你好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Pheebs, how's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.61,0:17:25.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我被开除  心脏病发作\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They fired me, and I'm having a heart attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.28,0:17:27.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,欢迎归队  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, welcome back. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.53,0:17:32.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  罗斯  嗨  瑞秋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hi, Ross. Hi, Rachel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.95,0:17:35.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,乔伊崔比亚尼在吗  不在\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Is Joey Tribbiani here? Um, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.91,0:17:39.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,如果你见到他  请转告他我在找他\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, if you see him, will you please tell him that I'm looking for him...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.58,0:17:43.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这一次  我不会吐了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and that this time I am not gonna throw up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.88,0:17:47.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗  我  我很好啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you okay? Me? I'm great!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.72,0:17:50.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我很好  我好的不得了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm fine! I'm so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.14,0:17:53.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是你知道  谁不好吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But you know who's not great?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.39,0:17:54.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,男人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Men!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.77,0:17:56.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你是男人  对吧  罗斯  对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You're a man, right, Ross? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.48,0:17:58.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,坐下  好\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sit down. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.98,0:18:01.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我问你一件事\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Let me, uh, ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.81,0:18:05.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,婚誓对你们来说是个屁吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Do wedding vows mean squat to you people?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.57,0:18:10.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么我们一说要出门\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And why is it that the second we tell you we're going out of town...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.49,0:18:14.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,砰  你们就跟邻居的遛狗小妹上床\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...bam, there you are in bed with the neighbor's dog-walker?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.75,0:18:19.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我们很抱歉\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We're sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.37,0:18:25.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我说真的  婚姻的神圣性呢\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, seriously. Seriously. What has happened to the sanctity of marriage?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.55,0:18:30.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你昨晚不是跟乔伊在一起  你是侦探吗\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Didn't you spend last night at Joey's? Oh, what are you, a detective?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.01,0:18:35.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道你和你丈夫怎么了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know what's going on with you and your husband...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.85,0:18:38.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,希望那位遛狗妹已经成年\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and what is hopefully an adult dog-walker.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.69,0:18:43.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但我要说  男人并非都是那样\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Look, can I just say, not all men are like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.61,0:18:45.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有些男人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Ugh. Hey, there are some men...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.27,0:18:47.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,愿意尽全力挽回婚姻\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...who'll do whatever to make their marriage work.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.99,0:18:50.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有些男人愿意退到一边\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There are some men who will stand by and watch...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.74,0:18:55.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看老婆跟健身房刚认识的女人打得火热\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...as their wives engage in what can only be described as a "twosome"...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.58,0:18:59.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,旁若无人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...with some woman she barely knows from the gym!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.21,0:19:02.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,这些男人是谁\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Who are these men?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.37,0:19:04.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就是我认识的一个人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Just men. A guy I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.96,0:19:08.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你可能要告诉他  听起来他的老婆\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Well, you might want to tell him it sounds like his wife...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.96,0:19:11.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,像是同性恋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...is gay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.30,0:19:13.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她才不是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She is not...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.85,0:19:19.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她是同性恋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She's gay-
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.48,0:19:23.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,天哪\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.73,0:19:28.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她好同性恋啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}She is so gay!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.78,0:19:34.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真不敢相信\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I can't believe this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.53,0:19:37.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,已婚者的黄道吉日\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Good day for married people, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.66,0:19:41.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很遗憾你老公不忠\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry your husband cheated on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.12,0:19:44.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,很遗憾你老婆是同性恋\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I'm sorry your wife is gay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.92,0:19:50.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看来女人也没那么好  去告诉我老婆啊\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I guess women aren't that great either. Try telling my wife that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.72,0:20:00.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我可以进来吗  进来  吃饭  随你便\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Okay to come in? Yeah, come in, eat, whatever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.39,0:20:02.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,罗杰医生又被叫走了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Dr. Roger got beeped again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.60,0:20:05.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  你猜是谁叫走他的\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, I know. Guess who beeped him?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.15,0:20:10.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什么  我就是那个脾脏破裂的病人\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What? I'm the ruptured spleen. Ha, ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.99,0:20:15.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么要这样  因为你不该和他在一起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why would you do that? Because you shouldn't be with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.20,0:20:20.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你应该和我在一起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You should be with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.25,0:20:25.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  对  听你聊罗杰\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Really? When you were talking about Roger...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.54,0:20:27.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,让我好痛苦\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...that was killing me. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.13,0:20:30.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,昨晚的事不能过了就算了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Things like last night don't just happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.63,0:20:34.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,至少对我来说不是  我是说  你和其他两个女人不同\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}At least not to me. I mean, with the other two women...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.01,0:20:41.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,和她们上床  通常我都早起  急着出去见朋友\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...in the morning, y'know I was just lying there and I couldn't wait to just go hang outwith my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.10,0:20:43.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是跟你\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But with you...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.69,0:20:48.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就像是跟朋友在一起\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...heh, I was, you know, already with a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.19,0:20:52.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,钱德  你八成不想跟我交往\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Chandler. I know you probably don't want to go out with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.94,0:20:56.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我太爱开玩笑  也没认真谈过感情\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I make too many jokes, I've never been in a serious relationship...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.82,0:20:59.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又不是一个 "医生"\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}...and I guess I'm not technically a "doctor."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.75,0:21:09.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你只有一个女人  对不对\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}There was just one woman, wasn't there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.84,0:21:12.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的  有两个\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No, there were two.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.59,0:21:14.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一个是我  正是\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Including me? Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.18,0:21:25.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,发了两次心脏病  才终于让你认清\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It only takes two heart attacks To finally make you see
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.31,0:21:30.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一次死不了  但第二次会让你解脱\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}One of them won't do it But the second will set you free
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.94,0:21:37.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉你的恨意与愤怒  是该道别了\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Tell all your hate and anger. It's time to say goodbye
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.82,0:21:40.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只要我的老板们一死\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}And that is just what I will do
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.45,0:21:43.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我就会这么做\N{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Soon as those bastards I worked for die
